    "name": "Effect: The Twelve Arms (Tridents)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.The Twelve Arms].</p><p>The Libra Saint has put the <strong>Tridents</strong> in your hands &mdash; both of them, one per hand, because an Arm is a matched pair and never arrives as half of one.</p><p>While you hold them you use <strong>the Saint's</strong> weapon proficiency, the weapons carry the Saint's full <strong>Arms Advance</strong> &mdash; potency and damage dice, whatever tier the Saint has reached, a lit sky included &mdash; their Cosmo Strike bonus, and you gain the Arm's Art at whatever tier the Saint has reached &mdash; Greater from their 8th level, Perfect from their 14th &mdash; @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Setting the Tide].</p><p>The weapons cannot be dropped involuntarily, and they return to the Cloth when this ends.</p><hr /><p><em>The Saint's proficiency rank and the Advance's two numbers are written in at the moment the Arm is handed over. The rule element only reaches a player character; an NPC ally is told so in chat instead.</em></p>"
        },
